gb11(){return"Lads, we're at home today. These stands are ours, this grass is ours."},
gb12(){return"We're in front of our own fans. They're waiting for us, and we owe them."},
gb13(){return"This is our ground, boys. Nobody comes here and plays at ease."},
gb0T(){return"We're away, lads. The stands are theirs, but it's eleven against eleven out there."},
gb0U(){return"Nobody here is going to help us. Whatever we take, we take ourselves."},
gb0V(){return"We've come a long way, boys. We didn't come to go home empty-handed."},
gb0W(){return"Everyone sees us as favourites. We'll prove it on the pitch, not on paper."},
gb0X(){return"We're expected to win this one. Doing what's expected is a craft too."},
gb1a(){return"We're up against a strong side today. Nobody gives us a chance. Good, let them think that."},
gb1b(){return"A tough evening awaits us. But big teams lose too, lads."},
